20	// group. enter on a group lists its findings, enter there opens the same detail as
21	// from the flat table, ctrl+o in that detail is the flat path's ctrl+o (same
22	// confirmation, same write, same re-scan), and the re-scan is the truth: the
23	// groups are read again from the result that comes back, never marked done. Every
24	// change happens in Update (Rule 110): these tests feed messages.
